    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Where did you leave off...? Ah yes, on the eve of Samhain, while the sun still hung in the sky.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Samhain nights bind life with death. This is no mere superstition. Or perhaps you could say it has long transcended superstition.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Taran legends speak of countless great deeds and tragedies occurring on this very night, and such tales often put the date front and center.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "So long as innumerable legends coincide on that day, and so long as the Tarans still remember, if only vaguely, to celebrate the harvest and light up fires on that day, it will never be a simple change of season.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "It itself is the perfect footnote to add to any myth.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "...Oh, and another thing. I don't suppose you'd mind if I gave the characters more fitting names, yes?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "59_g10_indoor",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The sun is leaning westward.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Have we yet to figure out how to go about this final confrontation?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "amount": 0.8,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "keep": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$darkness_03_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Loughshinny, why are you hiding in your room at dinnertime again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#13$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Dad angry?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warm Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, but he will be soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be down soon\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warm Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#22$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that on your desk?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warm Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The young red dragon tries to block her sister's line of sight with her body, but her effort is in vain."
    },
    {
        "text": "A small paper box sits on her desk, carefully lined with cotton. Inside lies a tiny fowlbeast\u2014already dead but still harboring a faint lingering warmth."
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems to have broken its leg while alive. An unsuccessful splint fashioned from stiff paper now lies in pieces around it, accompanied by a few grains of wheat."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#22$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the fowlbeast that sang at my window every morning. I don't know what happened to it, but... I wanted to save it, and...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warm Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#14$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I beg of you, Sister\u2014Tell Dad I'm only feeling ill. I'll be on time for dinner tomorrow... I'll bury it in the courtyard tonight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warm Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#22$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you're giving up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's already dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warm Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_atk_magic_n",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0.05,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0.05,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0.05,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Purple flames slip past the fowlbeast's feathers into its already cold body."
    },
    {
        "text": "The two watch as it slowly stands up, its broken leg stiffly propping itself up on the cotton."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. Would you like it to fly, or to sing a song for you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "N-No! This isn't right! Not like this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warm Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#16$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then why didn't you use your own flames on it while it was still alive?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#17$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your fowlbeast could have lived a much longer life. You do realize you aren't limited to how the mediocre masses do things, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Mum told me to swallow my flames, hide them away, and never let them be seen...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warm Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And who would see them in your own room?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Young Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The young dragon looks away to avoid her sister's eyes, but finds her gaze landing on the fowlbeast standing on its cotton bed instead."
    },
    {
        "text": "Purple fire burns in its eyes, and even the way it tilts its head is the spitting image of her sister."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Or do we perhaps still harbor unrealistic fantasies for how this could end?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "amount": 0.8,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "keep": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "34_g6_noblelivingroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Sister, you're covered in blood... were you injured?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Most of it isn't mine. The Duke's spy bled profusely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll replace your bandages.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where is the Earl of Warwick?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#6",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He has... work to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, so he says. And as always, you take him at his word.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#14$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He even allowed the spy to discuss poetry with you while he 'works'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought I'd been keeping mum about our origins, as well as anything related to the Earl's vision...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone in this manor knows you never say a word more than necessary. That has never been something the Earl would bother to check.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. Had we let the spy escape, the Earl would still inevitably find a way to silence him in the dark, and we'd simply find ourselves bound by yet another chain called caution.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no need for you to apologize. Apologies have never changed a thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once packed with guests, the long-empty parlor's acoustics now amplify the sound of the bandages being ripped apart, making the atmosphere even heavier."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those poems by that Seamus Williams you've been so into... If you can remember them, why not recite a line or two for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The noble red dragon racks her brains for a verse that would not rouse her sister's rage. Perhaps something related to Tara, brave warriors, or even ancient legends\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "But all she can recall are verses that stand aloof from worldly affairs."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "'The land is but a strange romance, the cause of its end lost to chance ill.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "'I am but a wandering bard, well-versed in lore from songs in the woods...'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "She sneaks a peek at her sister's face and sees no change, so she plucks up her courage and continues to recite more lines."
    },
    {
        "text": "Only when she finishes both the entire poem and the new bandage with a delicate knot does she realize that her sister has already fallen asleep, encircled by meter and rhyme."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
