        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Or perhaps...?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$calm_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Sister.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, Loughshinny. You've kept me waiting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What of your new friends? The wayward wakewoman, or perhaps that lively nomad?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "With your presence, any obstacles preventing you from bringing them along should have easily been reduced to naught.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're in the city, but this is a moment to be shared by us alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's cold out here on the balcony, so let us continue this in the corridor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A replica of where Labhr\u00e9athach died, in Na Saoirs\u00ed... Why must you cling onto our inglorious history and repeat it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#16$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see you've gained a deeper understanding of the word Tara.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if history does not repeat itself, then how can we speak of breaking the cycle?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "It can be very difficult to tell us apart by appearance.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "But the moment either of us speaks, it becomes as clear as night and day.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Eblana only ever steers the conversation toward her own interests, while Loughshinny is ever the polite one.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "She'd get to the bottom of this and find an ending\u2014",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Don't interrupt me, sir. I'm talking about the characters in the story.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "59_g11_castlecorridor_d",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Eblana.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I'm quite glad. You finally accepted my invitation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "To dance?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. To dance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll dance with you to the end, together. However...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please tell me first. The last time we met, you said you couldn't afford to wait any longer... What exactly is going on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "With that same smile of hers, the older sister stands at the end of the corridor, while the younger clutches her hands together and hides in the shadow of a wall lamp, hoping the other party won't notice her heart wavering."
    },
    {
        "text": "Poor thing. She could have concluded this farewell so much sooner."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've become... frail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "The flames of death must have their limits. Spreading them so far would certainly drag you down as fire after fire blooms, just like Labhr\u00e9athach back then... Am I right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see. While that ghost's fire might resemble mine, his temperament is closer to yours. It seems he's helped you quite a lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "At first he only wanted to watch all of Tara burn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was simply trying to keep it together...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The noble red dragon finally steps out of the shadows, walking forward to support her sister who seems on the verge of being unable to stand... just like before."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "At last you resemble your younger self, when you knew nothing of flames or fate. The you who tried to shield me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#16$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It has been a truly long time, Loughshinny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember. It was when Mrs. Murphy next door passed away. You didn't like her, but fancied the beautiful bouquet of flowers in her coffin...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you used your flames to change her body's position.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw scorch marks on the flowers and thought you'd be scolded, so I told our parents I was the one who did it. I even fabricated a story of how I opened and closed the coffin...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And so you were scolded instead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could poor Mum and Dad\u2014who couldn't even hide the flames in that family in time\u2014possibly have noticed the faint scorch marks on some flowers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Indeed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that why you've always been cowering?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would <i>you</i> blame every decision you've made in life on one unfortunate childhood experience?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So tell me, Sister. Tell me there's still time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll accompany you out of the citadel and into the square. Have the people return their flames to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll walk through Tara's fields with you, and gather the dead you've intentionally or unintentionally awoken with your Arts, sending them all to a peaceful rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll recite poems to you while you're weak, until you fall asleep and wake up again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's still time for all of that, yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I trust you to keep your word. Your noble nature would be appalled at the very thought of breaking a promise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what you just described, would that truly make you happy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or would that simply be enough to appease the Loughshinny Dublinn who did not even witness her parents' death, that snowy night? Those... beautiful fictions?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sister. Love, poetry, dreams\u2014those are all well and good, but it is time for you to wake up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kill me. If you truly wish to end this chaos, that is the only way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, put on the crown, and you shall become me, while I become you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is the one thing I cannot do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll have time to mull over it once I'm dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you decide not to hesitate anymore, Loughshinny?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#16$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's been no other choice for us from the moment you came back to see me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The older sister's mouth curls up in an intriguing arc."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come, dance with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this... the dance you've been looking forward to all this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#16$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why can't it be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The younger sister closes her eyes as she points her spear at her older sister, whose body is about to topple over. She grips her weapon with both hands."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cnstrctnck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_daggerslow"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The sharp speartip pierces the red dragon's body, but she stands unmoved, as if nothing happened at all, until her younger sister's hand circles her waist, and her body slowly crumples."
    },
    {
        "text": "...Just like the end of a dance."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "59_i08",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should have known long ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "But why? Why must it be now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Then when?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't tell me you'd prefer to stab my heart on a fine afternoon, after meticulously dissecting every nuance of right and wrong with me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "You returned to me, and we danced this dance together. That's enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I only thought... if my sorrow and hatred were thrown into a suitable flame, they'd eventually become the fuel for life to go on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorrow, and hatred... so you admit it, Loughshinny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your noble virtues have only hurt you in the end. Where is your fire, Sister?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't put out your flames just like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, you mean... the people in the city?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will die, but not now. Your flames will be extinguished at your funeral, at your fire-returning ceremony.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "But still, you ought to be dispelling death with scorching flames, rather than holding the hand of the dead and confessing your own inner turmoil, your own regrets. Otherwise...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will only ever be as you are now, letting go of your chance to save everything... your final chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greedy Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
